cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "QCM Viewer"
abstract: >-
  A local, file-backed interactive viewer and analysis tool for QCM-D and
  electrochemical QCM (EQCM) measurements. Imports raw instrument exports
  (Qsoft .txt, standardized CSV, PSTrace potentiostat CSV) and computes
  Δf/n, ΔD, Sauerbrey mass, charge, current density, and mass-per-electron
  with cycle-aware electrochemistry views, multi-run overlay, and
  reproducible notebook export.
type: software
authors:
